FORMATTER.md §3, GRAMMAR.md §2.6 and DECISIONS 178: a multiline string keeps its value: a
content line of blanks longer than the old prefix keeps what follows the prefix, and trailing
blanks of content lines stay (§2 yields to the value).
-- in.canon --
package p

let s = """
    a   
      

    b
    """
-- want --
package p

let s = """
  a   
    

  b
  """
